From: jsnd <ros2kil105@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:43:41 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Integrate speed+steering MPC into controller_manager
 (controller:=mpc)

- controller/mpc: integrated MPC copied unchanged from JSND_MPC
- Controller: MPC branch; VESC speed setpoint integrated from MPC
  acceleration (bounded by plan, max_speed, measured+lead; reset on stop)
- controller_manager: PP/MPC startup selector, real-car MPC allowed,
  FTGONLY keeps FTG, stale odom -> 0 in MPC mode
- race.launch.xml: controller:=pp (default, unchanged) | mpc; osqp via
  node-scoped PYTHONPATH
- config/mpc_car.yaml: conservative first-run limits

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
